{"strongs": "H2706", "word": "חֹק", "translit": "choq", "root": "חצר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "something prescribed, a statute or due", "definition": "חֹק 127 noun masculine Mic 7:11 something prescribed, a statute or due ; — ׳ ח Gen 47:22 + 22 t.; חָקֿ Exod 30:21 + 14 t.; suffix חֻקִּי Prov 30:8 + 3 t.; חָקְךָ Lev 10:13 ; Lev 10:14 etc. + 4 t. suffixes; plural חֻקִּים Deut 4:5 + 31 t.; construct חֻקֵּי Exod 18:16 חוּקֵּ֯י Ezek 20:18 also חִקֲקֵי Judg 5:15 ; Isa 10:1 ( Ges «GKC:93»§ 93 . 1 R 7); חֻקָּו֯ Job 14:5 etc. + 44 t. suffixes — 1. prescribed task , assigned to Israel in Egypt Exod 5:14 ( E ). 2. prescribed portion , or allowance of food Gen 47:22 (twice in verse) ( J ); Prov 30:8 ; Prov 31:15 ; Ezek 16:27 מחקי Job 23:12 ( RV ; < ᵐ5 ᵑ9 Ol Me Di SS בְּחֵקִי in my bosom ). 3. action prescribed for oneself, resolve: חִקֲקֵי לֵב Judg 5:15 resolves of mind || חִקְרֵי לֵב v Judg 5:16 . 4. prescribed due of the priests from offerings Lev 6:11 ; Lev 10:13 (twice in verse); Lev 10:14 (twice in verse) ( P ); due of ׳ י Lev 6:15 ( P ); עולם ׳ לח Exod 29:28 ; Lev 7:34 ; Lev 10:15 ; Num 18:8 ; Num 18:11 ; Num 18:19 (all P ), Lev 24:9 ( H ); portion of oil for the תּרומה Ezek 45:14 . 5. prescribed limit, boundary: of sea Jer 5:22 ; Prov 8:29 ; Job 26:10 ; Job 38:10 of heavens Ps 148:6 of land of Israel Mic 7:11 of time Job 14:5 ; Job 14:13 so פָּֽעֲרָה פִיהָ לִבְלִי חֹ֑ק Isa 5:14 Sh®°ôl openeth wide her mouth, without limit . 6. enactment, decree, ordinance of either God or man: \\ \\ a. specific decree: law of fifth in Egypt Gen 47:26 ( J ); of passover Exod 12:24 ( J ); lament for Jephthah's daughter Judg 11:39 for Josiah 2Chr 35:25 חק ומשׁפט Exod 15:25 ; Josh 24:25 (both E ), 1Sam 30:25 חק עולם Exod 30:21 || עֵדוּת , מִשְׁפָּט Ps 81:5 ; Ps 81:6 (law of a festival). \\ \\ b. of ׳ י in nature Job 28:26 . \\ \\ c. respecting Messianic king Ps 2:7 day of ׳ י Zeph 2:2 ᵑ0 , but on text see We and טֶרֶם , below; covenant with Jacob Ps 105:10 = 1Chr 16:17 destiny of man Job 23:14 . \\ \\ d. law in general עלי חק according to law, right Ps 94:20 (others against law ); ומשׁפט ׳ לַמֵּד ח Ezra 7:10 || בּרית and תורות Isa 25:5 || עדות Ps 99:7 . 7. plural חֻקִּים enactments, statutes of a law: \\ \\ a. of ׳ י in nature Jer 31:36 . \\ \\ b. of the prophets Zech 1:6 . \\ \\ c. conditions of deed of purchase Jer 32:11 . \\ \\ d. enactments || מִשְׁפָּטִים : ancestral Ezek 20:18 given by God as punishment for disobedience Ezek 20:25 . \\ \\ e. decrees of unjust judges חִקֲקֵיאָֿוֶן Isa 10:1 . feminine civil enactments prescribed by God: חֻקֵּי האלהים Exod 18:16 ( E ; || תּוֺרֹתָיו ), v Exod 18:20 ( E ; || id. ) \\ \\ g. elsewhere of prescriptions of the several codes of Hex: Lev 10:11 ; Num 30:17 ( P ), Deut 4:6 ; Deut 6:24 ; Deut 16:12 ; Ps 119:5 + 20 t., Mal 3:7 || ׳ תּוֺרַת י Amos 2:4 ותורות ׳ ח Ps 105:45 ׳ והח ׳ דברי הת Deut 17:19 || ברית Ps 50:16 וברית ועדות ׳ ח 2Kgs 17:15 usually either || משׁפטים Deut 4:1 ; Deut 4:5 ; Deut 4:8 ; Deut 4:14 ; Deut 5:1 ; Deut 11:32 ; Deut 12:1 ; Deut 26:16 ; 1Kgs 9:4 = 2Chr 7:17 ; 1Chr 22:13 ; Ezek 11:12 ; Ezek 36:27 , or else ומשׁפטים ׳ ח combined with other synonym (usually preceding): e.g. דבר(ים ׅ Ps 147:19 תורה 2Chr 33:8 ; Mal 3:22 מצוה Deut 5:28 ; Deut 6:1 ; Deut 7:11 מצות Neh 1:7 ; 1Kgs 8:58 מצוה , תורה 2Chr 19:10 עֵדֹת Deut 4:45 ; Deut 6:20 sometimes following: e.g. תורות Lev 26:46 מצוה , תורה 2Kgs 17:37 or in different order, e.g. ותורות ׳ מ ומצות ׳ ח Neh 9:13 ׳ וח ׳ מצות ומ Neh 10:30 ומצות ׳ ח ׳ ומ Deut 26:17 . Apart from משׁפטים it is combined with מצות , e.g. ׳ וח ׳ מ Exod 15:26 ( R ), Deut 27:10 ׳ ומ ׳ ח Deut 4:40 ; 1Kgs 3:14 ; 1Kgs 8:61 ותורה ׳ וח ׳ מ Neh 9:14 ׳ ועדות וח ׳ מ Deut 6:17 ; 1Chr 29:19 ; 2Chr 34:31 ׳ וח ׳ דברי מ Ezra 7:11 it is used with verbs: נתן Lev 26:46 + 3 t.; צוּה Num 30:17 + 9 t.; למּד Deut 4:1 + 10 t.; שׁמר Deut 26:17 + 16 t.; עשׂה Deut 6:24 + 5 t.; שׁמר לעשׂות Deut 11:32 + 4 t.; הלך בְּ 1Kgs 8:61 + 3 t. — [On usage of חֹק see חֻקָּה near the end]", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3072')\">BDB3072</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2706')\">H2706</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2711')\">H2711</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3071')\">BDB3071</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3073')\">BDB3073</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֹק</bdbheb><sub>127</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Mic 7:11\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,11)\">Mic 7:11</ref></sup> <highlightword>something prescribed, a statute or due</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 47:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,22)\">Gen 47:22</ref> + 22 t.; <bdbheb>חָקֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,21)\">Exod 30:21</ref> + 14 t.; suffix <bdbheb>חֻקִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 30:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,8)\">Prov 30:8</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>חָקְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 10:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,13)\">Lev 10:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 10:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,14)\">Lev 10:14</ref> etc. + 4 t. suffixes; plural <bdbheb>חֻקִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,5)\">Deut 4:5</ref> + 31 t.; construct <bdbheb>חֻקֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,16)\">Exod 18:16</ref> <bdbheb>חוּקֵּ֯י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,18)\">Ezek 20:18</ref> also <bdbheb>חִקֲקֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,15)\">Judg 5:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 10:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,1)\">Isa 10:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:93»§ 93</sup>. 1 R 7); <bdbheb>חֻקָּו֯</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 14:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,5)\">Job 14:5</ref> etc. + 44 t. suffixes — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>prescribed task</highlight>, assigned to Israel in Egypt <ref ref=\"Exod 5:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,14)\">Exod 5:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>prescribed portion</highlight>, or allowance of food <ref ref=\"Gen 47:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,22)\">Gen 47:22</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"Prov 30:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,8)\">Prov 30:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,15)\">Prov 31:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:27\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,27)\">Ezek 16:27</ref> <bdbheb>מחקי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 23:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,23,12)\">Job 23:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup>; &lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Me')\">Me</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <bdbheb>בְּחֵקִי</bdbheb> <highlight>in my bosom</highlight>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>action prescribed</highlight> for oneself, <highlight>resolve:</highlight> <bdbheb>חִקֲקֵי לֵב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,15)\">Judg 5:15</ref> <highlight>resolves of mind</highlight> || <bdbheb>חִקְרֵי לֵב</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Judg 5:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,16)\">Judg 5:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>prescribed due</highlight> of the priests from offerings <ref ref=\"Lev 6:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,11)\">Lev 6:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 10:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,13)\">Lev 10:13</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Lev 10:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,14)\">Lev 10:14</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <highlight>due</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,15)\">Lev 6:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>עולם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,28)\">Exod 29:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:34\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,34)\">Lev 7:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 10:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,15)\">Lev 10:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,8)\">Num 18:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,11)\">Num 18:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,19)\">Num 18:19</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lev 24:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,9)\">Lev 24:9</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); portion of oil for the <bdbheb>תּרומה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,14)\">Ezek 45:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>prescribed limit, boundary:</highlight> of sea <ref ref=\"Jer 5:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,22)\">Jer 5:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,29)\">Prov 8:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 26:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,10)\">Job 26:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,10)\">Job 38:10</ref> of heavens <ref ref=\"Ps 148:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,6)\">Ps 148:6</ref> of land of Israel <ref ref=\"Mic 7:11\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,11)\">Mic 7:11</ref> of time <ref ref=\"Job 14:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,5)\">Job 14:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,13)\">Job 14:13</ref> so <bdbheb>פָּֽעֲרָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>פִיהָ לִבְלִי חֹ֑ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,14)\">Isa 5:14</ref> <transliteration>Sh®°ôl</transliteration> <highlight>openeth wide her mouth, without limit</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>enactment, decree, ordinance</highlight> of either God or man: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>specific decree:</highlight> law of fifth in Egypt <ref ref=\"Gen 47:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,26)\">Gen 47:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); of passover <ref ref=\"Exod 12:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,24)\">Exod 12:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); lament for Jephthah's daughter <ref ref=\"Judg 11:39\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,39)\">Judg 11:39</ref> for Josiah <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,25)\">2Chr 35:25</ref> <bdbheb>חק ומשׁפט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,25)\">Exod 15:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 24:25\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,25)\">Josh 24:25</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,25)\">1Sam 30:25</ref> <bdbheb>חק עולם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,21)\">Exod 30:21</ref> || <bdbheb>עֵדוּת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 81:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,5)\">Ps 81:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 81:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,6)\">Ps 81:6</ref> (law of a festival). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> in nature <ref ref=\"Job 28:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,26)\">Job 28:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> respecting Messianic king <ref ref=\"Ps 2:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,7)\">Ps 2:7</ref> day of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:2\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,2)\">Zeph 2:2</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, but on text see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> and <bdbheb>טֶרֶם</bdbheb>, below; covenant with Jacob <ref ref=\"Ps 105:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,10)\">Ps 105:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,17)\">1Chr 16:17</ref> destiny of man <ref ref=\"Job 23:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,23,14)\">Job 23:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>law in general</highlight> <bdbheb>עלי חק</bdbheb> <highlight>according to law, right</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 94:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,20)\">Ps 94:20</ref> (others <highlight>against law</highlight>); <bdbheb>ומשׁפט</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לַמֵּד ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,10)\">Ezra 7:10</ref> || <bdbheb>בּרית</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>תורות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 25:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,5)\">Isa 25:5</ref> || <bdbheb>עדות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 99:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"99\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"99\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,99,7)\">Ps 99:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> plural <bdbheb>חֻקִּים</bdbheb> <highlight>enactments, statutes</highlight> of a law: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> in nature <ref ref=\"Jer 31:36\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,36)\">Jer 31:36</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of the prophets <ref ref=\"Zech 1:6\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,6)\">Zech 1:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>conditions</highlight> of deed of purchase <ref ref=\"Jer 32:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,11)\">Jer 32:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>enactments</highlight> || <bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּטִים</bdbheb>: ancestral <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,18)\">Ezek 20:18</ref> given by God as punishment for disobedience <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,25)\">Ezek 20:25</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>decrees</highlight> of unjust judges <bdbheb>חִקֲקֵיאָֿוֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,1)\">Isa 10:1</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlight>civil enactments prescribed by God:</highlight> <bdbheb>חֻקֵּי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>האלהים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,16)\">Exod 18:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>תּוֺרֹתָיו</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Exod 18:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,20)\">Exod 18:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; || <highlight>id.</highlight>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> elsewhere of prescriptions of the several codes of Hex: <ref ref=\"Lev 10:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,11)\">Lev 10:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,17)\">Num 30:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 4:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,6)\">Deut 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 6:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,24)\">Deut 6:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 16:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,12)\">Deut 16:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,5)\">Ps 119:5</ref> + 20 t., <ref ref=\"Mal 3:7\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,7)\">Mal 3:7</ref> || <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תּוֺרַת י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 2:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,4)\">Amos 2:4</ref> <bdbheb>ותורות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 105:45\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,45)\">Ps 105:45</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>והח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דברי הת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 17:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,19)\">Deut 17:19</ref> || <bdbheb>ברית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,16)\">Ps 50:16</ref> <bdbheb>וברית ועדות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,15)\">2Kgs 17:15</ref> usually either || <bdbheb>משׁפטים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,1)\">Deut 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,5)\">Deut 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,8)\">Deut 4:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,14)\">Deut 4:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 5:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,1)\">Deut 5:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:32\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,32)\">Deut 11:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,1)\">Deut 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 26:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,16)\">Deut 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,4)\">1Kgs 9:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,17)\">2Chr 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,13)\">1Chr 22:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,12)\">Ezek 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:27\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,27)\">Ezek 36:27</ref>, or else <bdbheb>ומשׁפטים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> combined with other synonym (usually preceding): e.g. <bdbheb>דבר(ים ׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 147:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"147\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"147\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,147,19)\">Ps 147:19</ref> <bdbheb>תורה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,8)\">2Chr 33:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:22\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,22)\">Mal 3:22</ref> <bdbheb>מצוה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 5:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,28)\">Deut 5:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 6:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,1)\">Deut 6:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 7:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,11)\">Deut 7:11</ref> <bdbheb>מצות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 1:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,7)\">Neh 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:58\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"58\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"58\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,58)\">1Kgs 8:58</ref> <bdbheb>מצוה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>תורה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 19:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,19,10)\">2Chr 19:10</ref> <bdbheb>עֵדֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:45\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,45)\">Deut 4:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 6:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,20)\">Deut 6:20</ref> sometimes following: e.g. <bdbheb>תורות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:46\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,46)\">Lev 26:46</ref> <bdbheb>מצוה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>תורה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:37\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,37)\">2Kgs 17:37</ref> or in different order, e.g. <bdbheb>ותורות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>ומצות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,13)\">Neh 9:13</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מצות ומ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,30)\">Neh 10:30</ref> <bdbheb>ומצות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ומ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 26:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,17)\">Deut 26:17</ref>. Apart from <bdbheb>משׁפטים</bdbheb> it is combined with <bdbheb>מצות</bdbheb>, e.g. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,26)\">Exod 15:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 27:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,27,10)\">Deut 27:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ומ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:40\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,40)\">Deut 4:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,14)\">1Kgs 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:61\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"61\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"61\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,61)\">1Kgs 8:61</ref> <bdbheb>ותורה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,14)\">Neh 9:14</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ועדות וח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 6:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,17)\">Deut 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,19)\">1Chr 29:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:31\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,31)\">2Chr 34:31</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דברי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,11)\">Ezra 7:11</ref> it is used with verbs: <bdbheb>נתן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:46\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,46)\">Lev 26:46</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>צוּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,17)\">Num 30:17</ref> + 9 t.; <bdbheb>למּד</bdbh